haodi-q-p034","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-35d064e11b05dfeb4b27","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之以为：壹畏逼归命，事无可嘉。格以古义，欲盖而名彰者也。当时之宜，未得远遵式典；固应量才受赏，足以酬其来情而已。至乃光锡八命，礼同台鼎，不亦过乎！于招携致远，又无取焉。何者？若使彼之将守，与时无嫌，终不悦于殊宠，坐生叛心；以叛而愧，辱孰甚焉？如其忧危将及，非奔不免，则必逃死苟存，无希荣利矣：然则高位厚禄，何为者哉？魏初有孟达、黄权，在晋有孙秀、孙楷。达、权爵赏，比壹为轻；秀、楷礼秩，优异尤甚。及至吴平，而降黜数等；不承权舆，岂不缘在始失中乎？","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":574,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ad4fae97affa47236d4e","start":0,"end":228,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-03eacb2be0d3764d8557","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-f65ba97b8a7bc23d2f78","layer":"original","quote":"晋以秀为骠骑将军，仪同三司，封会稽公","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-4a7e5567cb2d60bed41d","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b23e76cc61a495cb2f8a","layer":"original","quote":"秀公室至亲〖3〗，握兵在外，皓意不能平。建衡二年，皓遣何定，将五千人，至夏口猎","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-63add2c2583dcdcf9975","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b23e76cc61a495cb2f8a","layer":"original","quote":"先是，民间佥言秀当见图〖4〗；而定远猎〖5〗，秀遂惊：夜将妻子亲兵数百人奔晋","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":40,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-759a9d4b02f9ad90c7e8","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-8ddb0a1b1e0b7f157769","layer":"pei","quote":"吴平，降为伏波将军，开府如故。永宁中卒，追赠骠骑、开府","attribution":"裴注·晋诸公赞","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":171,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a894451a6ed9a28bec1c","start":121,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-98aba9e9067377432321","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-8ddb0a1b1e0b7f157769","layer":"pei","quote":"秀在晋朝，初闻皓降，群臣毕贺；秀称疾不与，南向流涕曰：‘昔讨逆弱冠以一校尉创业，今后主举江南而弃之；宗庙、山陵，于此为墟：悠悠苍天，此何人哉！’朝廷美之","attribution":"裴注·干宝晋纪","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":171,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a894451a6ed9a28bec1c","start":34,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-d394a19294806fa95bb7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-8ddb0a1b1e0b7f157769","layer":"pei","quote":"皓大怒，追改秀姓曰‘厉’","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":171,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a894451a6ed9a28bec1c","start":11,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q2-5f9a1176d541d428fb8f","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-8ddb0a1b1e0b7f157769","layer":"pei","quote":"永宁中卒，追赠骠骑、开府。","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":171,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a894451a6ed9a28bec1c","start":136,"end":149,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
